  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pakistan Skills Impact Bond Launch Support (Technical Assistance)300539-409</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO have supported the British Asian Trust with the finalization of the design and launch of the Pakistan Skills Impact Bond through an accountable grant agreement. There was a formal launch event in Islamabad in December 2025. Instiglio was the design partner, which supported the final design framework. And through the grant BAT has supported government to develop a framework agreement. The grant agreement was signed 26th November 2025 and the grant closed 31st of March 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
